// IntroString :
"P1518062884" "I have something that requires your attention. Sometime soon, the Family is going to do an arson job on a local business. It belongs to someone in their organization, who wants the insurance money. In addition to the property damage, the Family is arranging for several people to be in the building when the fire starts, so that it will seem more like an accident. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to the office, prevent the fire from starting, and rescue the people that are being held by the family.</A> <color orange>The fire bombs they use have to be disarmed simultaneously, so bring along a couple of teammates.</color> You only have 90 minutes to stop the attack."
// AcceptString :
"P3240529788" "Go to the office, prevent the fire from starting, and rescue the people that are being held by the family."
// SendOffString :
"P3415755741" "You'll need to concentrate on disabling the devices that will start the fire and rescuing the innocents. Don't worry too much about the individual Family goons."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2276290615" "Prevent the Family arson job"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1888274820" "That office is going to go up in flames soon, you have to hurry! You'll need to concentrate on disabling the devices that will start the fire and rescuing the innocents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1933498859" "You know that time is not on your side. Finding those fire bombs and innocents are the absolute priority."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1334112634" "Hostage"
// Description :
"P2527878156" "hostages"
// SingularDescription :
"P1514198225" "One hostage left"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1024038423" "I have no idea why they dragged me here, but I am very glad you showed up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P534076737" "I think they are going to burn this place to the ground!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Bombs 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2757223601" "Fire bomb"
// Description :
"P3297591645" "bombs to disarm together"
// SingularDescription :
"P3404023956" "Disam the bombs"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1739327960" "{Rescuer} begins disarming the bomb."
// InteractWaitingString :
"P2973810470" "The bomb's countdown pauses."
// InteractResetString :
"P1194863133" "The bomb's countdown resumes."
// InteractInterruptedString :
"P663232666" "{Rescuer} has been interrupted!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1398268651" "You have disarmed the bomb."
// InteractActionString :
"P1388010237" "Disarming..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2623751424" "You stopped the fire bombs and rescued the innocents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2436938362" "You failed to prevent the Family from carrying out their plan."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P628500947" "It's hard to think about how callus the Family could be towards those people's lives. It's sickening, {HeroName}. That's not even to mention how far that fire might have spread."
// RandomFameString :
"P1629500798" "Keep up the good work, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1157859852" "I wish you had been faster, {HeroName}. The building is gutted, but at least those captives managed to get out in when the Family left early."
// RandomFameString :
"P3524836881" "The Paragon City Fire department was barely able to contain a blaze that started in an office building today."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_TheFamily_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2323053230" "I have a warning for you, {HeroName}. My contacts tell me that the Family have put the word out that you're not welcome in Independence Port. They've put a hit on you, and a bounty for any family member who takes you down. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think you might want to be a bit pro-active and take the fight to them</A> on the streets of Independence Port."
// AcceptString :
"P1300939519" "Take the fight to the Family in Independence Port."
// SendOffString :
"P1113451815" "The Family don't play around, {HeroName}. You'll have to defeat about 30 of them or so to get the message across that you're not playing either. If you're having trouble finding them, you might want to try the Justice Quay."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1942883124" "Defeat the Family in Independence Port"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3111223527" "There's {HeroName}! Get him!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3410099688" "You've taught the Family the lesson. The hit is off."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P151460172" "The Family have withdrawn the hit on you. You caused enough damage that it was just too dangerous for them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_TheFamily_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3080297899" "The Small business association in Independence Port are reporting an increase in activity by the Family in the zone. They're pushing people around and acting like they're the real power in the area. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>People are hoping that a hero will be willing to show those thugs who the real power in the city is</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P2616024003" "Defeat members of the Family in Independence Port"
// SendOffString :
"P805860170" "Defeating about 30 Family members or so should be enough to demonstrate that they're not untouchable. I've heard that they've recently stepped up operations around Power Island, but you should be able to make an impression on them anywhere in the zone you can find them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3857817339" "Whaddaya doin' {HeroName}? We're untouchable around here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3760917723" "You have defeated enough The Family"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P488555254" "Thugs like the Family always try to assert their power over honest people. As long as there are heroes to stand against them, they won't be able to get away with it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_TheFamily_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2949382739" "The Family have started leaning on the businesspeople of Independence Port. They seem to think that with so much hero attention going to protecting Terra Volta or fighting groups like the Council and the Freakshow, they're free to do as they please. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like to see them taught just how wrong they are.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2571370991" "Fight the Family in Independence Port"
// SendOffString :
"P374868003" "If the Family thinks heroes aren't paying attention to their crimes they're sure to try and increase their activity. If you can defeat about 30 of them, they should be able to get the message."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1280432027" "Go to Industry Pier in Independence Port and defeat The Family"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3299100801" "We're the ones in charge a business here, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4207116581" "You really showed the Family, {HeroName}! They won't think that they can escape the notice of Paragon City's heroes for some time after all of this. The City's businesspeople are thankful."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL5_TheFamily_Mission5.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2744779991" "Word on the street is that Frankie Frost, the nephew of Family head Sebastian Frost, is in big trouble. His uncle has called for him to be killed, apparently because the punk was skimming. How stupid can you be? Frankie might be willing to talk if he thinks that it he could be protected, and that could hurt the Family badly. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to prevent Frankie from sleeping with the fishes.</A> He's on the run right now; you've only got 90 minutes to find him."
// SendOffString :
"P608126298" "Frankie took to the streets this morning. I called for an emergency force field, but I'm afraid I may not have been fast enough to keep the Family from tailing him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1947894806" "Capture Frankie & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3875737658" "Frankie won't last long on those streets. That kid needs to be brought into protective custody, for his own good."

